Her bank offers loans at 6% per annum compounded monthly.

Louise plans to make the following repayments on the loan account.

\begin{itemize}
\item She will pay \$500 at the end of each month for the first two years.
\item She will increase this to \$800 at the end of each month for the next two years.
\end{itemize}

